    <description>The user dashes into their target and erupts into a relentless flurry of slashes — so rapid the air itself fills with dust and mist. At the height of the storm, the cloud closes around the user completely, swallowing them from sight and leaving behind a disorienting haze that makes them nearly impossible to track.</description>
